# Optional. When set, the AI critique/summary/comment features make real
# OpenAI Chat Completions calls. When unset, the app falls back to scripted
# (deterministic) responses tuned for "The Masque of the Red Death."
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your key.
#
# VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# VITE_OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
